      {
        "ContentType": "Location",
        "SortOrder": 10,
        "Content": "Rathóg enjoys a peaceful rural setting at Ballintubber, alongside open farmland with stunning countryside views, yet is just off the N25 Cork–Waterford route and equidistant between Midleton and Carrigtwohill, minutes from Fota Island Resort. Both towns offer an excellent range of amenities including shops, cafes, restaurants, schools, sports clubs, bus services and commuter rail stations, while Cork city centre is approximately 15 minutes’ drive away.\r\nEnjoy the best of East Cork living, with beautiful beaches and scenic coastal drives on your doorstep, while the vibrant town of Cobh, the bustling Midleton Farmers Market and renowned Ballymaloe House are all within easy reach. Fota Island Resort is just a 5-minute drive away, offering a world-class golf course, spa, dining and leisure facilities, with Fota Wildlife Park and Fota House & Gardens a mere 10 minutes from your door.\r\nRathóg is a rare opportunity to secure a home of this size, privacy and quality so close to the city, in one of East Cork’s most sought-after areas."
      }
